## Troubleshooting

### "File not found" error in app
- Ensure filename is exactly: `OpenDyslexic-Regular.ttf` (case-sensitive)
- Delete this placeholder file
- Restart Metro bundler: `npx expo start --clear`

### Font not loading on device
- Check file is valid TrueType (.ttf) format
- Verify file size is not 0 bytes
- Look for console errors in Expo

### License Questions
- OpenDyslexic is free for personal and commercial use
- Attribution is required (include credit in app)
- Modifications allowed (but must retain license)

